    "collapsible_row_lab_report_M9q4YL": {
      "type": "collapsible-row-lab-report",
      "blocks": {
        "content_aktRRe": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "1. Why do we test every product?",
            "content": "<p>Because your health deserves certainty, not assumptions. At B'spoke, we test every batch of every product to ensure that what’s on the label is exactly what’s in the bottle. It’s our commitment to purity, potency, and full transparency — no shortcuts, no compromises.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "content_JfAPwr": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. Why do we share our lab reports with you?",
            "content": "<p>We share our lab reports because we believe you have a right to know exactly what you're putting into your body. Transparency is a core part of our values, and providing lab results allows you to see the verified quality, purity, and potency of our supplements for yourself. These third-party or in-house lab reports confirm that our products meet strict safety standards and contain exactly what’s listed on the label—nothing more, nothing less. By making this information accessible, we aim to build trust and empower you to make informed decisions about your health and wellness. When it comes to your well-being, you shouldn’t have to take our word for it—you deserve real proof.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "content_UyGEgK": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3. Why do we test ingredients?",
            "content": "<p>Ingredient testing is one of the most important steps in producing safe, reliable, and effective supplements. We test our ingredients before they ever make it into a capsule or bottle to ensure they meet strict standards for purity, potency, and identity. This is crucial because once ingredients are combined into a final product—especially in complex formulations—it can be difficult or even impossible to accurately test the potency of each individual component. By verifying potency at the raw ingredient stage, we can confidently ensure that you’re getting exactly what the label promises. In short, ingredient testing isn’t just a step in our process—it’s a foundation of our commitment to quality and transparency.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "content_kUtqpV": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "4. Why do we test the final product?",
            "content": "<p>Testing the final product is essential to ensure that everything meets our high standards before it reaches you. While ingredient testing verifies the quality and potency of raw materials, final product testing confirms that the finished supplement is consistent, safe, and accurately labeled. This includes checking for contaminants, verifying that the active ingredients are present at the correct levels, and ensuring the product is stable and performs as intended. It’s a critical quality control step that helps catch any issues that could arise during manufacturing—like cross-contamination, ingredient degradation, or incorrect dosages. Final product testing is how we deliver on our promise of safety, reliability, and full transparency with every bottle.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
